            "reviewer_name": "Sarah M.",
            "reviewer_meta": "Mom of 2 · Texas"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "quote": "We bought this for our 8-year-old and he hasn't put it down. Best educational purchase we've ever made. Worth every penny!",
            "reviewer_name": "James R.",
            "reviewer_meta": "Dad of 3 · California"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "quote": "The quality is outstanding and the content is perfectly pitched for kids. My son loves reading it before bed — it's replaced screen time completely.",
            "reviewer_name": "Emily T.",
            "reviewer_meta": "Mom of 1 · New York"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "quote": "I was skeptical at first but this exceeded all my expectations. My twins fight over who gets to read it next. Highly recommend!",
